OL,3,ADaniel Thomas jailed for 15 months for
OL,4,Aslashing dinghy
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnti-migrant activist Daniel Thomas has
OL,7,Fbeen jailed for 15 months for slashing
OL,8,Fa dinghy with a knife in the English
OL,9,FChannel.
OL,11,FThe 37-year-old, known to his
OL,12,Fsupporters as Danny Tommo,
OL,13,Flive-streamed himself cutting the boat
OL,14,Fwhile a French rescue worker was on
OL,15,Fboard in September.
OL,17,FSentencing him after he admitted
OL,18,Fcriminal damage, a judge called Thomas
OL,19,Fa "publicity seeker" whose actions were
OL,20,Fa "flagrant interference" with the work
OL,21,Fof rescue crews.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
