OL,3,ARussia targets Kyiv crossings days
OL,4,Aafter Ukraine hits Crimean Bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussia targeted bridges in Kyiv and
OL,7,Frailway stations overnight in a major
OL,8,Fattack launched days after Ukraine
OL,9,Fbadly damaged the strategically
OL,10,Fimportant Crimean Bridge.
OL,12,FBallistic missiles hit key crossings in
OL,13,Fthe capital during a nationwide assault
OL,14,Fwhich Ukrainian President Volodymyr
OL,15,FZelensky said was "one of the most
OL,16,Fmassive strikes" of the war so far and
OL,17,Fleft at least nine dead.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
