OL,3,ARussia targets Kyiv crossings days
OL,4,Aafter Ukraine hits Crimean Bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FRussian President Vladimir Putin had
OL,7,Fthreatened to retaliate for the attack
OL,8,Fon the Crimean Bridge, which the
OL,9,FKremlin built to link Russia and the
OL,10,Foccupied Crimean peninsula.
OL,12,FThe latest Russian strikes coincided
OL,13,Fwith talks around the war, and came as
OL,14,Fthe Kremlin pushed back against a US
OL,15,Fclaim that Russia could be open to
OL,16,FWestern-backed security guarantees for
OL,17,FUkraine.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
